---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="How Lead Flow Automation handles the personal data you share through this website."
>
  <header class="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/">LEADFLOW<span>AUTOMATION</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="body">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 2 September 2026</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by Gergely Racz, trading as Lead Flow Automation
        ("we", "us"). For any privacy question or request, contact
        <a href="mailto:gergelyracz0@gmail.com">gergelyracz0@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
      <p>
        When you request materials through a form on this site (for example the AI starter pack
        or the AI Operating Map), we collect the details you enter: typically your name, work
        email, role and company size, and — if you completed the self-check — the two
        self-assessment scores you chose to share. We use these details to deliver the
        materials you requested and to follow up on any conversation you request. If you
        tick the optional box asking for occasional practical AI notes, we also use your email
        for that purpose until you opt out; the box is never pre-ticked.
      </p>
      <p>
        The AI Readiness &amp; Exposure Check itself runs entirely in your browser — your answers
        are not sent anywhere unless you submit the request form at the end.
      </p>

      <h2>Where the data goes</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are collected via Tally (form provider, EU-based) and stored in Airtable
        (our CRM). If you book a call, scheduling is handled by Calendly. Each acts as a processor
        for the data you submit through it. We do not sell or share your details with anyone else.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep contact records for as long as we are in an active conversation or business
        relationship with you, and delete them on request at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR you can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal
        data, object to or restrict its processing, and withdraw consent at any time — email
        <a href="mailto:gergelyracz0@gmail.com">gergelyracz0@gmail.com</a>. You also have the
        right to lodge a complaint with your supervisory authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This site sets no advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="bottom">
    <div class="wrap">
      Lead Flow Automation · Gergely Racz · <a href="/">leadflowautomation.net</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  .top { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 18px 0; }
  .wordmark { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-primary); text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark span { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .body { padding: 48px 0 40px; }
  h1 { font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 36px); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .updated { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 26px; }
  h2 { font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-size: 19px; margin: 26px 0 8px; }
  p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  a { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bottom { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); margin-top: 30px; padding: 22px 0 34px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .bottom a { color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
</style>
